{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_202", "type": "agent_message", "text": "The tab-width chooser is on the toolbar’s long-press Indent action. Selecting width 2 changed the open editor’s next indent from four spaces to two, and I restored width 4 and undid the temporary edits. The code-block preview also shows monospace text on a shaded panel; I’m checking a clean multi-line emphasis range before closing the remaining preview cases."}}
